    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Nominated members of Parliament participate in the election of the Vice President, unlike in the Presidential election.",
        "Members of State Legislative Assemblies (MLAs) do NOT participate in the election of the Vice President.",
        "A resolution to remove the Vice President can ONLY be initiated in the Rajya Sabha, not in the Lok Sabha."
      ],
